5. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, August to September came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 155% of normal in April to May and 48% in October to November. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 40% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
